        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - International tourist arrivals comparison 2009-2010</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLFOdaXQXo81HuxXYt4lD4hSgmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BcAqdmlrvo9YfQxQ8txlkhjdgtd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i International tourist arrivals comparison 2009-2010 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về số lượng du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế đến 9 quốc gia v&agrave;o hai năm: 2009 v&agrave; 2010, đồng thời so s&aacute;nh mức thay đổi.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3LtdQTfLo1VDvxozLglWV05gXe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IRiCdhn6DoEFZYxcYWalJ3Kbgvb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề International tourist arrivals comparison 2009-2010 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: Lượng du kh&aacute;ch từ nước ngo&agrave;i - 9 quốc gia (France, US, Spain, UK, Italy, Turkey, China, Germany v&agrave; Hong Kong) - số liệu tuyệt đối v&agrave; tương đối (absolute and relative terms) - Hai năm li&ecirc;n tiếp: 2009 v&agrave; 2010</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VUCbdIJLNoa83HxibjUl3jeugxc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMfZdZ3hhoHVmbxF3jDlUvmdgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Trends</strong>: hầu hết c&aacute;c quốc gia đều đ&oacute;n nhiều du kh&aacute;ch hơn v&agrave;o năm 2010, ngoại trừ France (giữ nguy&ecirc;n) v&agrave; Hong Kong (giảm).</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FMfZdZ3hhoHVmbxF3jDlUvmdgwh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><strong>Differences</strong>: France c&oacute; lượng du kh&aacute;ch cao nhất (most popular destination), trong khi Germany ghi nhận mức tăng trưởng đ&aacute;ng kể nhất (most significant growth).</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Oo2UdJWyfogutexlC8Dlib9Vgae\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> France, US, Spain, UK v&agrave; Italy (The most visited nations)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LIordh8JDosEIYx1KpdlG6Bhgwe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQP3dbhx6owmoJxKB19lMfSYgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2009 của c&aacute;c quốc gia trong nh&oacute;m n&agrave;y</strong> <em>(US c&oacute; 66 triệu du kh&aacute;ch, Spain v&agrave; UK mỗi nước c&oacute; 55 triệu du kh&aacute;ch cao hơn Italy 11 triệu, Italy c&oacute; 44 triệu du kh&aacute;ch)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQP3dbhx6owmoJxKB19lMfSYgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả mức tăng của US, Spain, UK v&agrave; Italy</strong> <em>(c&aacute;c quốc gia n&agrave;y tăng từ 1 đến 2 triệu du kh&aacute;ch, tương đương mức tăng trưởng từ 1.5% đến 3.6%)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GQP3dbhx6owmoJxKB19lMfSYgUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả t&igrave;nh h&igrave;nh của France</strong> <em>(France dẫn đầu danh s&aacute;ch với 76 triệu du kh&aacute;ch v&agrave;o năm 2009 v&agrave; giữ nguy&ecirc;n con số n&agrave;y v&agrave;o năm 2010)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BQRsdAy1tor0z6xpumhlnvFNgeg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> Turkey, China, Germany v&agrave; Hong Kong (The remaining countries)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fvhed7nhSoM7J9xQ4K2lNdClgth\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2009 của c&aacute;c quốc gia c&ograve;n lại</strong> <em>(Turkey c&oacute; 33 triệu du kh&aacute;ch cao hơn China 11 triệu, China c&oacute; 22 triệu du kh&aacute;ch cao hơn Germany 11 triệu, Germany c&oacute; 11 triệu du kh&aacute;ch)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả mức tăng của Turkey, China v&agrave; Germany</strong> <em>(cả 3 quốc gia đều tăng 12 triệu du kh&aacute;ch, với mức tăng trưởng tương đối lần lượt l&agrave; 33%, 55% v&agrave; 109%)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">(Step 3)<strong> M&ocirc; tả t&igrave;nh h&igrave;nh của Hong Kong </strong><em>(Hong Kong l&agrave; điểm đến k&eacute;m hấp dẫn nhất, giảm từ 10 triệu xuống 9 triệu v&agrave;o năm 2010, tương đương mức giảm 11%)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcKgd2ZQhoZ6q3xBXhJl7Hbvg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULeBdpxNfowzy4xT48xldjB9gjb\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>số</strong> <strong>lượng du kh&aacute;ch quốc tế\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ULeBdpxNfowzy4xT48xldjB9gjb\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">international tourist arrivals</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">visits from overseas</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">visitors / tourists</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">people traveled to [Country]</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nn2Udq05AoSDbQxU5omlCJnOgAf\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nn2Udq05AoSDbQxU5omlCJnOgAf\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">The table illustrates the changes in<strong> visits from overseas</strong> to 9 countries, in both absolute and relative terms.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">66 million <strong>people traveled to the US.</strong></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVC9dIn9JoNl68xeLyVl5XPvg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">Spain and the UK each attracted 55 million<strong> tourists.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 3301,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The table illustrates the changes in visits from overseas to 9 countries, in both absolute and relative terms, in two consecutive years, namely 2009 and 2010.</p>",
            "question_id": 42235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3302,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, with the exception of France and Hong Kong, all the countries welcomed more tourists in 2010. In addition, France was the most popular destination, while the most significant growth was seen in Germany.</p>",
            "question_id": 42235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3303,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the most visited nations, in 2009, while 66 million people traveled to the US, Spain and the UK each attracted 55 million tourists, which was 11 million higher than Italy. An increase from 1 to 2 million was subsequently witnessed in these countries, equivalent to 1.5% to 3.6% growth. Meanwhile, France's number topped the list at 76 million in 2009, and remained unchanged in the following year.</p>",
            "question_id": 42235,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 3304,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>With regard to the remaining countries, the number of visitors to Turkey was 33 million, 11 million higher than that of China, which in turn outnumbered the next country, Germany, by the same margin. There was a rise of 12 million in the figures for all the 3 nations, with their relative growth being 33%, 55% and 109%, respectively. Hong Kong was the least appealing tourist destination, with its numbers declining from 10 to 9 million in 2010, representing a drop of 11%.</p>",
